Design adapted from dime-online/qwen3.8-Flash-DGX-UltraFast at revision
0c391a3e74b6a775cfe248691ca7fd855b1876a5, licensed under Apache-2.0.

The mlx2 implementation is an original MLX port. It retains the design's
restricted-support proposal law and full-width negative-infinity scatter, but
uses mlx2 artifact binding, adapter policy, diagnostics, and constrained-lane
fallback contracts. No vLLM or CUDA/Marlin implementation is included.
